Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.88,0:02:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,風夏 我不是想催妳 但歌詞怎麼樣了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯..抱歉 還差一點..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.09,0:02:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,總之妳加油吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,嘛嘛 這種情況說這個話有點..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.41,0:02:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啊 我只是在鼓勵她啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.87,0:02:42.64,Default,,0,0,0,,反而會給她造成壓力的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.26,0:02:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那個什麼.. 慢慢來快快好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.41,0:02:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你在說什麼？完全不明所以
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,這是我體貼人的方式好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.18,0:02:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,微妙地沒有體貼到人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}當然有了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.08,0:02:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,還好嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:02:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.07,0:02:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}但是你每句話都帶刺
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.55,0:03:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}才沒帶刺咧 我很溫柔吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.56,0:03:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,如果有什麼我能幫上忙的 希望妳告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}說話方式不能再婉轉一點嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我很婉轉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}我很婉轉好不好 懂嗎？大笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,話是這麼說 但我也沒寫過歌詞
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,或許幫不上什麼大忙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.29,0:03:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不要你管！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣反而會讓我著急的啦
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Songtitle,,0,0,0,,ED「雪花火」作詞、作曲：川嶋愛，編曲：伊賀拓郎，主唱：冰無小雪（早見沙織）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:30.10,IN_JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}あなたに恋して...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:30.10,IN_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}愛上的人能夠是你...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:43.74,IN_JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}こわいものなんてないくらいただ笑ってた
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.63,0:03:43.74,IN_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}當時什麼都不怕 只是單純歡笑著的我們倆
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:49.56,IN_JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}あの頃の2人でよかったけど
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:49.56,IN_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}雖然那是我今生最美的時光
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:53.10,IN_JP,,0,0,0,karaoke,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}二度とはもう戻れない..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:53.10,IN_TW,,0,0,0,,{\blur4\bord4\3c&HE3AE75&}但再也回不到..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.24,0:03:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到我家的廢物老哥 竟然是當紅歌手的男友
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所謂的「青梅竹馬最強說」嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.87,0:03:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,就算是這樣..
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.97,0:03:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 講成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.90,0:03:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,對小雪也不好意思吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,戀愛和樂團兩邊都揮灑著青春呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.58,0:03:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,不過 他改變了很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.69,0:03:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,確實是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,不要管我！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,喂？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.09,0:04:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,小優？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.48,0:04:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.27,0:04:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也不是有什麼事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那個..關於作詞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.26,0:04:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.23,0:04:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我在想 自己是不是說了什麼不經過大腦的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.95,0:04:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那個..所以才惹秋月生氣了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.89,0:04:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,別太勉強自己了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.02,0:04:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像老是說這句話啊 對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.91,0:04:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你用不著道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.10,0:04:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起..啊 我又說了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.47,0:04:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,那打擾到妳就不好了 我先掛了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.46,0:04:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.00,0:05:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,對我這麼溫柔 要我怎麼辦才好啊..
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:25.43,phone,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs50\bord0\frz13.03\c&HA19398&\pos(770,789)}來電
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:25.43,phone,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\fs50\bord0\frz13.03\c&HA19398&\pos(782,877)}小玉
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.33,0:05:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,小玉？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.51,0:05:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,妳還在工作嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.03,0:05:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 現在在錄影
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.43,0:05:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,妳好像很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.81,0:05:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 不過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.78,0:05:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我好像能去看阿笑你們的演唱會哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.17,0:05:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那我得更加油才行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.89,0:05:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼樣？還順利嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,原創歌曲做好了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.36,0:05:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,這個嘛 歌詞還沒寫好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.39,0:05:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,小玉妳..寫歌詞的時候都是怎麼寫的？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那傢伙似乎相當糾結
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.05,0:06:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,但是寫詞方面因人而異
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.99,0:06:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我可能說不出什麼值得參考的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.85,0:06:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我沒有寫過歌詞 沒辦法幫上秋月什麼忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.97,0:06:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,所以想說小玉的方法 或許可以給她靈感..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.53,0:06:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我的歌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.50,0:06:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,一直都是為了喜歡的人寫出來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,風夏之前說過她沒有喜歡的人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.91,0:06:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我想 我的方式沒有辦法給她當作參考
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.58,0:06:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 沒有辦法給出什麼好建議
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不會
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.39,0:06:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.50,0:06:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣子不行啊..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.21,0:07:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然是單戀啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.35,0:07:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,一邊想著向那個人傳達的心情一邊寫歌的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.00,0:07:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然那個時候不明白
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.38,0:07:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,但現在我懂了..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.04,0:07:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,要是沒有察覺到這份感情就好了..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.63,0:07:27.11,Default,,0,0,0,,明明至今為止連想都沒有想過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,現在我..能明白這股心情究竟是什麼...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜歡小優..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,秋月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.03,0:08:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,妳怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.97,0:08:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,能幫我聽聽嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.04,0:08:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,妳做好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.38,0:08:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.35,0:08:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.07,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,果然在這裡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,總算完成了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.45,0:08:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.07,0:08:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,也讓我聽聽看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.61,0:08:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:53.15,Default,,0,0,0,,現在優大在聽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.30,0:08:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,吶 來排練一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.55,0:08:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.84,0:09:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不要對我展露這種笑容...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,今天拿出最棒的表演吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.99,0:09:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我們會去看演唱會的 你可要認真點哦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.00,0:09:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不用來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,啊啦 這可是我們弟弟大放異彩的舞台嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.27,0:09:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,吶吶 小雪也會來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.94,0:09:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,不曉得耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.23,0:09:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真容易看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.29,0:09:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,會來呢..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.50,0:09:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 妳們兩個..
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.90,0:09:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.17,0:09:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.49,0:09:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼事啊？奶奶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.69,0:09:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs44}※日本有習俗認為用打火石敲出火花能趨吉避凶、帶來好運
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.83,0:10:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,保佑演唱會能順利
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.04,0:10:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.86,0:10:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那我出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.42,0:10:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,路上小心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.98,0:10:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,好好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.97,0:10:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,老爺 少爺回府了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.78,0:10:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.16,0:10:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見了呢 實琴
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.34,0:10:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？快點進屋嘛..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有必要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.59,0:10:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是現在就此放棄音樂回來的話就進屋子
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是 這次我真的會跟你斷絕父子關係
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.89,0:10:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸..
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你要說的就是這件事嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.31,0:10:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,不可能永遠都讓你隨心所欲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.44,0:10:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我接下來還有表演
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.41,0:10:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你還沒清醒過來嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.46,0:10:51.81,Default,,0,0,0,,把時間浪費在沒用的事情上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.70,0:10:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,恕我直言 這對我來說是很重要的事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:10:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.78,0:11:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,等等呀 你就這麼走出家門的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.61,0:11:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那對我來說是最重要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.19,0:11:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我要去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.25,0:11:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那我等等也去露個臉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,順便和老闆道個謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.75,0:11:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.00,0:11:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,沙羅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.47,0:11:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,去帥他們一臉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.37,0:11:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 明明沒一個樂團能待很久的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.59,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,是待起來特別舒服嗎？還是說沙羅也長大了呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.93,0:11:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,不 這不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 阿矢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.79,0:11:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.73,0:11:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今天我帶很少露面的傢伙來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.76,0:12:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,小玉 阿笑
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.46,0:12:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,好久不見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,唷
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.15,0:12:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你們兩個什麼時候回來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.99,0:12:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,話說妳到底晃去哪了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.47,0:12:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,六年！六年了耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.14,0:12:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,已經過那麼久了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.22,0:12:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,真是 也不聯絡一聲
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.22,0:12:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,其實我有件事要對大家說
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.84,0:12:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,哦？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.84,0:13:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你並沒有遲到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.88,0:13:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,果然就是會忍不住早點來嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.74,0:13:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,現在只剩秋月了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.08,0:14:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,妳找死啊！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,對..對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小心點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 我遲到了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.29,0:14:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,慢死了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.37,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,很擔心妳呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.93,0:14:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,遇上什麼事了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那我們去締造傳說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我們是 The Fallen Moon 大家好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.07,0:15:06.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼請欣賞 Hedgehogs的《Climber's High！》
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:25.43,Default,,0,0,0,,演奏我們的歌啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.59,0:15:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,很厲害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.13,0:15:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他們都是我的學生哦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.91,0:15:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,話說還真虧妳能當的上老師
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.94,0:15:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我的ON和OFF是可以俐落地切換的喲
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,要說的話 不應該是真實和表面嘛？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.29,0:15:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼..那個吉他手是尚志的妹妹？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.79,0:15:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,滿厲害的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.83,0:15:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,還可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,那女孩不錯
Comment: 0,0:15:06.56,0:16:36.54,Songtitle,,0,0,0,,IN 「Climber's High!」 作詞：瀨尾公治，作曲：WEST GROUND，編曲：SHO from MY FIRST STORY，主唱：風夏(Lynn)
